    {
      "parameters": {
        "description": "Fetch on-chain transaction receipt status for Ethereum, BSC, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, and Base. When a user provides a txid, you MUST use this tool. You must pass both the network and txid separated by a comma (e.g., 'ethereum,0x123...' or 'polygon,0x123...'). If the network is not explicitly mentioned by the user, default to 'ethereum'.",
        "jsCode": "// 1. 네트워크와 해시 분리\nconst parts = query.split(',');\nconst rawNetwork = (parts[0] || 'ethereum').toLowerCase().trim();\nlet txid = (parts[1] || query).replace(/['\"]/g, '').trim();\n\n// 2. 0x 없이 64자리 hex만 넣은 경우 자동 복구\nif (!txid.startsWith('0x') && /^[a-fA-F0-9]{64}$/.test(txid)) {\n  txid = '0x' + txid;\n}\n\n// 3. EVM 포맷 정규식 검사 (0x + 정확히 64자리 16진수)\nconst isEvmFormat = /^0x[a-fA-F0-9]{64}$/.test(txid);\n\nif (!isEvmFormat) {\n  // [INTERNAL_DIRECTIVE] LLM에게 내리는 내부 지시. 유저에게 이 문장 그대로 노출 금지.\n  return \"[INTERNAL_DIRECTIVE] Non-EVM hash detected. DO NOT show this message to user. Instead: 1) Identify network from hash (Solana=base58 88chars, BTC=64hex). 2) In [ANSWER], respond in Korean: guide user to appropriate explorer (Solscan for Solana, Blockchain.com for BTC). 3) Tell user CS team has been notified for manual processing. 4) Set [ACTION] to ESCALATE.\";\n}\n\n// 4. 네트워크 -> Chain ID 라우팅\nconst chainMap = {\n  \"ethereum\": 1,\n  \"bsc\": 56,\n  \"polygon\": 137,\n  \"optimism\": 10,\n  \"arbitrum\": 42161,\n  \"base\": 8453\n};\nconst chainId = chainMap[rawNetwork] || 1;\n\n// 5. Etherscan V2 API 호출\nconst url = `https://api.etherscan.io/v2/api?chainid=${chainId}&module=transaction&action=gettxreceiptstatus&txhash=${txid}&apikey=YOUR_ETHERSCAN_API_KEY`;\n\ntry {\n  const response = await this.helpers.request(url);\n  const data = JSON.parse(response);\n\n  if (data.status === \"1\" && data.result && data.result.status === \"1\") {\n    return `On-chain (${rawNetwork}): Confirmed. Exchange has not credited yet.`;\n  } else if (data.status === \"1\" && data.result && data.result.status === \"0\") {\n    return `On-chain (${rawNetwork}): Transaction Failed.`;\n  } else {\n    return `On-chain (${rawNetwork}): Pending or Not Found.`;\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  return `On-chain API Error (${rawNetwork}): ` + e.message;\n}\n"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolCode",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
